								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=825.msg7920#msg7920">Re:Lineage II ?</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #1 on:</b> May 13, 2004, 08:38:25 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							A friend of mine was messing with it for a short while. He said it is pretty, but it does not draw you in in the way that EQ does. (course he plays DAOC, so what does he know about anything?)<br /><br />
